<Item XName="EQ_PhaseNoise" UserName="EQ_PhaseNoise" Type="Equation">
<Selected><T>Bool</T><D>0</D></Selected>
<Text>% Phase noise from the SVB-S2X appendix on simulation, at two different service levels&#x000D;&#x000A;%&#x000D;&#x000A;% Typical broadcast Service&#x000D;&#x000A;%LO_PNDATA=[1e3,-50, 1e4,-73, 1e5, -93, 1e6, -103]&#x000D;&#x000A;% &#x000D;&#x000A;% Critical professional services (256-APSK)&#x000D;&#x000A;LO_PNDATA=[1e3,-79, 1e4,-89, 1e5, -95, 1e6, -106];&#x000D;&#x000A;</Text>
